IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg5-s221-s224-bonds-and-records`
IMPORT `dg5-s241-s242-amendment`

-- Tests of dg5-s221-s224-bonds-and-records.l4 (8 Del. C. ss 221 and 224).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text (src:891 and 911 of de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt), beside the assertion.
-- The module that holds section 242 is imported only to test the one cross-reference inside this piece (section 221 to section 242(b)(2)).

§ `Section 221`

-- helper arguments, in order: holds obligations, the certificate confers the power to vote, confers the right of inspection, confers another right, deems the holders stockholders.
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 221 Holder of obligations of the corporation`
`dg5 test holder` a b c d e MEANS
    `dg5 s 221 Holder of obligations of the corporation` WITH
          `the person holds bonds, debentures or other obligations issued or to be issued by the corporation` IS a
        , `the certificate of incorporation confers the power to vote in respect to the corporate affairs and management` IS b
        , `the certificate of incorporation confers the same right of inspection of the books, accounts and other records that the stockholders have` IS c
        , `the certificate of incorporation confers another right that the stockholders have` IS d
        , `the certificate of incorporation provides that the holders of obligations are deemed to be stockholders` IS e

#ASSERT `s 221 the holder of obligations may vote on the corporate affairs and management` (`dg5 test holder` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of obligations may vote on the corporate affairs and management` (`dg5 test holder` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of obligations may vote on the corporate affairs and management` (`dg5 test holder` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 221 the holder of obligations has the stockholders' right of inspection` (`dg5 test holder` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of obligations has the stockholders' right of inspection` (`dg5 test holder` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of obligations has the stockholders' right of inspection` (`dg5 test holder` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 221 the holder of obligations has another right that the stockholders have` (`dg5 test holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of obligations has another right that the stockholders have` (`dg5 test holder` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 221 the holder of obligations is deemed a stockholder, and the obligation a share of stock, for a vote of stockholders required by the chapter` (`dg5 test holder` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of obligations is deemed a stockholder, and the obligation a share of stock, for a vote of stockholders required by the chapter` (`dg5 test holder` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of obligations is deemed a stockholder, and the obligation a share of stock, for a vote of stockholders required by the chapter` (`dg5 test holder` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- Divestiture of the holders of capital stock, except the class vote of section 242(b)(2).
#ASSERT `s 221 the holder of capital stock has been divested of the right to vote on the matter` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of capital stock has been divested of the right to vote on the matter` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 221 the holder of capital stock has been divested of the right to vote on the matter` FALSE FALSE)
-- The cross-reference composed: an amendment that decreases the par value of a class gives the class a vote under section 242(b)(2), so a divestiture does not reach it.
`dg5 test par value change` MEANS `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Effect of a proposed amendment on a class` WITH `the amendment would increase or decrease the aggregate number of authorized shares of the class` IS FALSE, `the amendment would increase or decrease the par value of the shares of the class` IS TRUE, `the amendment would alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of the shares of the class so as to affect them adversely` IS FALSE, `the amendment would so affect only 1 or more series of the class and not the entire class` IS FALSE, `the certificate provides that the number of authorized shares of the class may be changed by the vote of a majority of the stock entitled to vote` IS FALSE, `the amendment would take the number of authorized shares of the class below the number then outstanding` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 221 the holder of capital stock has been divested of the right to vote on the matter` TRUE (`s 242(b)(2) the holder is entitled to vote as a class` (`s 242(b)(2) the holders who vote as a class on the amendment` `dg5 test par value change`) TRUE FALSE) EQUALS FALSE

§ `Section 224`

-- helper arguments, in order: kept in an information storage form, convertible to legible paper within a reasonable time, the records are the stock ledger,
-- the ledger can prepare the list of stockholders (ss 219, 220), records the information in ss 156, 159, 217(a) and 218, records transfers as governed by Article 8 of Title 6.
GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 224 Records kept by the corporation`
`dg5 test records` a b c d e f MEANS
    `dg5 s 224 Records kept by the corporation` WITH
          `the records are kept on, or by means of, or in the form of, an information storage device, method, or 1 or more electronic networks or databases` IS a
        , `the records can be converted into clearly legible paper form within a reasonable time` IS b
        , `the records are the stock ledger` IS c
        , `the stock ledger can be used to prepare the list of stockholders specified in ss 219 and 220` IS d
        , `the stock ledger records the information specified in ss 156, 159, 217(a) and 218` IS e
        , `the stock ledger records transfers of stock as governed by Article 8 of subtitle I of Title 6` IS f

-- Ordinary records: only the conversion to legible paper within a reasonable time is needed.
#ASSERT `s 224 the records may be kept in that form` (`dg5 test records` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the records may be kept in that form` (`dg5 test records` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the records may be kept in that form` (`dg5 test records` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- The stock ledger: all three further conditions.
#ASSERT `s 224 the records may be kept in that form` (`dg5 test records` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the records may be kept in that form` (`dg5 test records` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the records may be kept in that form` (`dg5 test records` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the records may be kept in that form` (`dg5 test records` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
-- On the request of a person entitled to inspect, the corporation converts the records into paper.
#ASSERT `s 224 the corporation must convert the records into clearly legible paper form on the person's request` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the corporation must convert the records into clearly legible paper form on the person's request` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the corporation must convert the records into clearly legible paper form on the person's request` FALSE TRUE)
-- The paper form is valid and admissible if it accurately portrays the record.
#ASSERT `s 224 the paper form is valid and admissible in evidence and accepted for all other purposes to the same extent as an original paper record` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the paper form is valid and admissible in evidence and accepted for all other purposes to the same extent as an original paper record` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 224 the paper form is valid and admissible in evidence and accepted for all other purposes to the same extent as an original paper record` FALSE TRUE)
